      "content": "hey i got a transcript from one of our support calls that we need to put into the new training manual. the customer was a bit upset so it's kinda messy. can u rewrite this into proper professional business english so our trainers can use it? \n\ntranscript:\n\"look i been callin for like three days now and nobody doin nothin. i told yall my package was supposed to be here last week and it still ain't show up. i'm tired of all these excuses, y'all just keep sayin they lookin into it but i ain't seen nothing. i need my money back if yall cant get it here today.\"",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
